DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43016::$$$message_0355_0000_0000$$$::"...It's freezing.[lr]::
43017::$$$message_0355_0000_0001$$$::Lord mage? Hm, I thought he went on ahead..."::
43018::$$$message_0355_0000_0002$$$::"(...Oh, someone's already here.[lr]::
43019::$$$message_0355_0000_0003$$$::I don't recognize him. Perhaps he belongs to the temple...)"::
43020::$$$message_0355_0000_0004$$$::"Hello. May I join you?"::
43021::$$$message_0355_0000_0005$$$::"By all means. This is a natural hot spring bath.[lr]::
43022::$$$message_0355_0000_0006$$$::It would hardly be elegant of me to claim it as my own."::
43023::$$$message_0355_0000_0007$$$::"(He's a good man!)"::
43024::$$$message_0355_0000_0008$$$::"Then if you'll excuse me...[lr]::
43025::$$$message_0355_0000_0009$$$::Ah, do you mind if I remove my mask?"::
43026::$$$message_0355_0000_0010$$$::"Go ahead.[lr]::
43027::$$$message_0355_0000_0011$$$::It would be rather unceremonious to wear glasses in the bath, after all."::
43028::$$$message_0355_0000_0012$$$::"(Not just a decent man; a paragon!)"::
43029::$$$message_0355_0000_0013$$$::"Pardon me, then.[lr]::
43030::$$$message_0355_0000_0014$$$::Ah, I'm missing some skin on my face. I hope you don't mind."::
43031::$$$message_0355_0000_0015$$$::"Not at all.[lr]::
43032::$$$message_0355_0000_0016$$$::It's not as if your internal organs are on display. It's no skin off my back, if you will."[nolr]::
43033::$$$message_0355_0000_0017$$$::"..."::
43034::$$$message_0355_0000_0018$$$::"..."::
43035::$$$message_0355_0000_0019$$$::"...Erm.[lr]::
43036::$$$message_0355_0000_0020$$$::Have you seen anyone else enter this bath?"::
43037::$$$message_0355_0000_0021$$$::"No. I believe we are the only ones here."::
43038::$$$message_0355_0001_0000$$$::"Ahh, this is a fine bath.[lr]::
43039::$$$message_0355_0001_0001$$$::I'm unused to the land here, but I'm impressed by its scenery."::
43040::$$$message_0355_0001_0002$$$::"Oh!?[lr]::
43041::$$$message_0355_0001_0003$$$::D-don't tell me, are you..."::
43042::$$$message_0355_0001_0004$$$::"Whew. I must say, this is delightful.[lr]::
43043::$$$message_0355_0001_0005$$$::I feel as if I've come back to life... [hfwww layer=1]No, as if I've regained my lost youth."::
43044::$$$message_0355_0001_0006$$$::"H-he really turned back into a young man!"[nolr]::
Á